                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Last April 2021 ERIM ran the Open Science Survey among all ESE and RSM \nresearchers. In this session we will focus on the top 3 concerns \nresearchers rose in the survey about preregistration. In this panel, \nGabriele Paolacci (RSM), Julia Rose (ESE), and Antonia Krefeld-Schwalb \n(RSM) will tell us how to tackle these concerns.  <br>"
